{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_118_1000_005yay", "source_sha256": "fdb5becc0b86de5953caee08d6071dafb331ff33ca2ca8469857815f4e8a969c", "ja": "ふぅ……。\n雪歩さん、律子さん、\nレッスン、お疲れさまでした！", "zh": "呼……。\n雪步，律子，\n练习辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_118_1001_004yuk", "source_sha256": "701b20cf22ec0b6f6621e0295aeb06c345841a2d96132d8be6b3b910771276d8", "ja": "やよいちゃんこそ、お疲れさま。\n今日も朝から、お仕事の\nロケだったんでしょ？", "zh": "弥生才辛苦了呢。\n今天也是从一大早就去\n出外景工作了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_118_1002_005yay", "source_sha256": "8d1c4a84ed40b45e7cb407e6211d1bee57655097beaee5317c432d7aab210cb9", "ja": "はい！　商店街の朝市を\nリポートして……でも大丈夫です、\n私、早起きですから！　……ふぁ。", "zh": "是的！我去报道了商店街的早市……不过没关系，我习惯早起！……哈啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_118_1003_009rit", "source_sha256": "a7b3eebb434e8d0079b60ea23e919e17bb4410540f891d76faecedee80274d61", "ja": "あくびが出てるわよ、やよい。\n一仕事した後にレッスンじゃ、\n無理ないけど……ふふっ。", "zh": "你都打哈欠了哦，弥生。\n忙完一阵后还要来训练，\n会觉得累也很正常……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
